<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-054" chapter-id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family" source-id="s-jinshu-054-wikisource-lu-family">
  <p id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p001:m0000" ref="69h_uhy_hta">陸機</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p001:m0001" ref="69h_uhy_hta">士衡</persName>，吳郡人也。祖<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p001:m0002" ref="8kb_zhi_yt3">遜</persName>，吳丞相。父<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p001:m0003" ref="8kb_zhi_yt3_A">抗</persName>，吳大司馬。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">時年四十三。二子<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p003:m0000" ref="8kb_zhi_yt3_AAA">蔚</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p003:m0001" ref="8kb_zhi_yt3_AAB">夏</persName>亦同被害。<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p003:m0002" ref="69h_uhy_hta">機</persName>既死非其罪。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p002:m0000" ref="8kb_zhi_yt3_AB">雲</persName>字<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p002:m0001" ref="8kb_zhi_yt3_AB">士龍</persName>，六歲能屬文，性清正，有才理。少與兄<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p002:m0002" ref="69h_uhy_hta">機</persName>齊名</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p004" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p004:m0000" ref="8kb_zhi_yt3_AB">雲</persName>弟<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p004:m0001" ref="8kb_zhi_yt3_AC">耽</persName>為平東祭酒，亦有清譽，與<persName id="c-jinshu-054-lu-family:p004:m0002" ref="8kb_zhi_yt3_AB">雲</persName>同遇害。</p>
</text>
